        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees will be provided information to enroll in their Plan choices, Decline all medical/vision coverage, Medical/Vision, Dental, AD&D, FSA's, STD, LTD and all OLI's. Plan coverage will become effective on the date of hire. No EOI or dependent eligibility back-up documentation will be required for new hire enrollments.",
